  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat 2021.1.3p2\nBuild Number 1058\nHello, i noticed something weird happening as soon as a person uses the Radial Menu on an Avatar. If you are in a world that uses the VRChat Damage System and someone else or you opens the Radial Menu Puppet, it starts to freeze the whole player IK for everyone, as soon as the person closes the Radial Puppet, the IK starts to work again.\nYou can try it yourself and heres how:\nGo to a world that uses the VRC Damage System (Example what we used, Rum Hams world, and also one of my private ones) wait for everyone to load in, and then go to your 3.0 menu and select a Radial Puppet, see what happens!\nHeres also a Video about how we did it.\nhttps://youtu.be/ZJ4FeTS4W68\nIt would be great if this is fixed!",
